      "submission": {
        "op": "submit",
        "status": "answered",
        "diagnosis": "get_openapi_path first copies route.responses into operation responses, then unconditionally assigns the generated 422 entry whenever parameters or a body exist. That later assignment overwrites an explicitly supplied 422 model. Both additional-response model schemas and the generated validation response hard-code application/json, whereas the primary response already uses route.response_class.media_type. Custom exception handlers affect runtime behavior and are not consulted by this schema builder.",
        "proposed_change": "Preserve an explicitly documented 422 response instead of replacing it; add the automatic validation response only when no relevant error response has been supplied. Use the selected response class media type when constructing response content, with an explicit fallback if it is absent. Add schema tests covering custom media types, custom 422 models and the default JSON behavior. Do not infer an arbitrary exception handler's error schema automatically.",
